            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Eileen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I only put in a sprinkle of salt, if any. I used whole wheat white flour and add a mashed banana and/or applesauce for extra moistness, sweetness, flavor and nutrition. I omitted the butter and added vanilla. Then...my daughter said they were the best pancakes I ever made.",
